      <CodeBlock code={"--- a/audacity-book.ditamap\n+++ b/audacity-book.ditamap\n@@ -69,6 +69,9 @@\n   <appendix href=\"topics/supported-audio-formats.dita\" keys=\"formats\"/>\n   <appendix href=\"topics/effects-reference.dita\" keys=\"effects\"/>\n   <appendix href=\"topics/effect-presets.dita\"/>\n+  <appendix href=\"topics/scripting-reference.dita\" keys=\"scripting\">\n+    <topicref href=\"topics/exporting-from-a-script.dita\"/>\n+  </appendix>\n \n   <backmatter>\n     <booklists>"} lang="diff" title="audacity-book.ditamap" />
      <p>The full guide gets an <em>Automation</em> head for the task and the reference under <em>Reference</em> with the key <code>scripting</code>; the podcaster guide takes both under its <em>Reference</em>; in the book the reference is a fourth appendix with the task as its section, and carries the key <code>scripting</code> too, so the podcast workflow's link to it resolves in the PDF. The beginner guide does not get them.</p>
      </Step>
